{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The&nbsp;proposed flat would fail&nbsp;to comply with the internal space standards for a studio flat and would result in the provision of&nbsp; sub-standard quality of accommodation.&nbsp;This&nbsp;is unacceptable and contrary to the following:DCLG Technical Housing Standards (nationally described space standard) (DCLG, March 2015) (as amended)Policy D6,&nbsp; Policy H1 and H2 and Table 3.1 of the London Plan (March 2021)Policy SP3, DMD 1 and Part 6 of policy DMNE1 of the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan 2037 (September 2024)Housing Design Standards LPG (June 2023)",
    "&nbsp;The proposal fails to&nbsp;demonstrate that the development would have capacity to facilitate and manage adequately-sized bin and bike storage areas which are functional, well-located and secure. The proposal lacks clarity and is therefore is unacceptable and contrary to the following: - Policy T5 of the London Plan (March 2021)-&nbsp;Policy&nbsp;DMT3 and&nbsp;Part 3 in policy DMSI 8&nbsp;of the Local Plan (September 2024)-&nbsp;The Council&#39;s Planning Advice Note on Waste and Recycling Provisions in New and Refurbished Residential Developments (dated 20/05/2021).",
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;The proposed development&amp;nbsp; fails to provide an acceptable quality of accommodation,&amp;nbsp; would cause a loss of local amenity including to neighbouring occupiers, and would not be located in an area with a high level of access to public transport. Specifically, the proposed ground floor unit would not have adequate levels to sunlight, would not be appropriate within the existing commercial context and would not provide safe and secure access to the unit. As such, the proposal is considered to have a detrimental impact on the borough&#x27;s supply of family housing and is contrary to the following policies:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework (December 2024)&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Policies&amp;nbsp;D6, D14 and T4&amp;nbsp;of the London Plan (March 2021)&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Policies SP3, SP8, DMD1, DMT1, DMH5 and DMSI3&amp;nbsp;of the Barking and Dagenham Local Plan 2037 (September 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
